## Complete CCW Education: What You Need to Know

### Why In-Person CCW Training Matters

In Virginia, online CCW classes are **not** recognized as a valid means of obtaining a permit. To qualify for your Virginia Concealed Handgun Permit (CHP), you must complete an in-person, certified firearms training course that demonstrates competence.

### CCW Course Options in Northern Virginia

Live Fire Instruction offers several state-approved CCW education pathways:

| Course | Duration | Best For |
|--------|----------|----------|
| [First Step Pistol Orientation](/first-step-pistol-orientation-fairfax-va) | 3+ hours | Absolute beginners, busy professionals |
| [NRA Basic Pistol Course & VA CCW](/nra-basic-pistol-course-fairfax-va) | 6 hours | First-time shooters, comprehensive training |
| [NRA CCW Advanced Pistol Course](/nra-advanced-ccw-fairfax-va) | Varies | Experienced shooters, defensive mindset |
| [One-on-One Personal Training](/private-shooting-lessons-northern-va) | 60 minutes | Customized, individualized instruction |

### What You'll Learn in CCW Education

A comprehensive concealed carry course covers far more than just shooting:

- **Firearm Safety** – Master essential safety rules to prevent accidents.
- **Virginia Concealed Carry Guidelines** – Understand where and how you can legally carry.
- **Marksmanship Skills** – Improve accuracy, control, and confidence.
- **Self-Defense Techniques** – Learn how to respond effectively in defensive situations.
- **Permit Application Guidance** – Get help navigating the Circuit Court application process.

